<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Privacy · Way to Asia</title><meta name="description" content="How Way to Asia handles travel enquiries and client communications."></head><body><main><a href="/en" translate="no">Way to Asia</a><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Updated 4 October 2026.</p><p>When you contact Way to Asia or request a journey, we use your contact details, travel requirements and messages to prepare proposals, answer your questions and manage your travel request. Please avoid including sensitive documents or financial information in an enquiry.</p><h2>Enquiries and communications</h2><p>We keep enquiry details, proposals, client responses and relevant communications in a private staff dashboard. Authorized staff may add internal notes, assignments and follow-up dates. Staff access is restricted and administrative changes are logged.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts our website and enquiry database. Resend handles enquiry notifications and proposal emails. Journey Designer also uses OpenAI and travel research or supplier services to prepare your requested itinerary. Relevant information is processed by these providers to deliver those services; processing may involve international transfers. Private staff notes are not submitted to itinerary-generation services.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask about your information, request a correction, obtain a copy or request deletion by contacting us through the <a href="/en/contact">contact page</a>. We review requests and any applicable obligations before completing deletion. Provider records and recovery backups may require separate handling. We keep information for handling enquiries, providing requested services and meeting applicable record-keeping obligations.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Optional website analytics only run after you accept analytics cookies. You can change your choice through the website cookie controls. The private dashboard does not include analytics.</p></main></body></html><style>body{font:16px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif;background:#f3eedf;color:#172b23;margin:0}main{max-width:760px;margin:auto;padding:2rem 1.25rem 4rem}h1{font-size:2rem;margin:1rem 0}h2{font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:1.8rem}a{color:#8b3425}</style>
